/-!
# Lemma 7.1's joint statement on the three-curve space

Packet PROVE-LEMMA72B. Specification §7.1 (`source/spec/p193-240.md` L540–L642, pp. 221–227).

PROVE-LEMMA72 proved `Prop73Ref.EmbeddedPairStatement` from the named input `Lemma72.Lemma71JointStatement`: the
chart-form pocket coupling on one space, the pulled-back field `h_ψ`, the locality (L) of the hulls for `h_ψ`, and
Lemma 7.2's ingredients (i) `h` determined by `(Q, h_ψ)`, (ii) the history determined by `(h, Q)`, (iii)
`(history, h_ψ) ⫫ Q`. This file works on the cycle-free **three-curve space** (`Lemma71I.exists_threeCurveSpace_planar`:
the GFF of Figure 7.1 and its flow lines `β = η_{θ₂}`, `α = η_{θ₁}`, `γ = η_0` with Lemma 6.2's hypotheses, built
from the §4.2 non-boundary inputs only, as ruling R43 requires), with the exterior record
`Q = ((β, α), h|_{ℍ ∖ C̄})` (`pocketRecord`), and **proves (i) and (ii)** there:

* (i) `isAEDeterminedBy_field_of_pocket`: thin-support removal on `∂C ⊆ β ∪ α` (Aux. lemma 12 with the flow-line
  dimension bound, Aux. lemma 15; (SR1) for the GFF), with the record inside the pocket read through the chart
  (`Lemma72B.exists_record_in`) and the record off `C̄` read from `Q` (`Lemma72B.exists_version_of_recorded_sides`);
* (ii) `Lemma72B.isAEDeterminedBy_killedHistory_of_le_curves`: the pocket filtration is generated by the three
  field-determined curves.

What remains is stated as **one named input on that space**, `PocketJointStatement`: for every three-curve space, the
pocket construction of Lemma 7.1 on the same space (`IsPocketChartData`: the chart-form coupling clauses, the chart a
function of the two outer curves, `∂C ⊆ β ∪ α`, the filtration generated by the three curves; PROVE-LEMMA71J's target
`Lemma71PocketPinStatement` in fixed-space form) together with Lemma 7.1's joint law: the locality (L) of the mapped
hulls for `h_ψ` and the independence (iii) of `(history, h_ψ)` from `Q`.

## Main results

* `IsThreeCurveSpace`, `exists_isThreeCurveSpace` (repackaging `Lemma71I.exists_threeCurveSpace_planar` with Aux. lemma
  56 discharged by `WholeField.retainedRangeEntranceStatement`);
* `outField`, `pocketRecord`, `measurable_pocketRecord`;
* `IsPocketChartData`, `PocketJointStatement` (**named input**);
* **`isAEDeterminedBy_field_of_pocket`** (ingredient (i) on the three-curve space);
* **`lemma71JointStatement_of_pocketJoint`**: `Lemma72.Lemma71JointStatement` from the §4.2 reference, Proposition 5.5
  in `ℍ`, Lemma 6.13's (MD1) exclusion and `PocketJointStatement`;
* `embeddedPairStatement_of_pocketJoint`: `Prop73Ref.EmbeddedPairStatement` likewise.

Conditional helpers; they replace no source theorem.
-/

